---
// Love letter section - a heartfelt letter that reveals on scroll
---

<section class="love-letter-section" id="loveLetterSection">
  <div class="letter-container">
    <!-- Envelope SVG -->
    <div class="envelope-wrapper reveal-scale" id="envelope">
      <div class="envelope-svg-container">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 320 220" class="envelope-svg" id="envelopeSvg">
          <!-- Envelope body (white) -->
          <rect x="10" y="60" width="300" height="150" rx="8" fill="#f5f0eb" stroke="#d4c5b5" stroke-width="2"/>
          
          <!-- Envelope interior (light gray, hidden initially) -->
          <rect x="12" y="62" width="296" height="146" rx="7" fill="#e8e2dc" class="envelope-interior" opacity="0"/>
          
          <!-- Letter peeking out (hidden initially) -->
          <rect x="30" y="70" width="260" height="130" rx="4" fill="#fff" stroke="#eee" stroke-width="1" class="envelope-letter-peek" opacity="0"/>
          <line x1="50" y1="95" x2="270" y2="95" stroke="#e0d5cc" stroke-width="1.5" class="envelope-letter-peek" opacity="0"/>
          <line x1="50" y1="115" x2="270" y2="115" stroke="#e0d5cc" stroke-width="1.5" class="envelope-letter-peek" opacity="0"/>
          <line x1="50" y1="135" x2="200" y2="135" stroke="#e0d5cc" stroke-width="1.5" class="envelope-letter-peek" opacity="0"/>
          
          <!-- Bottom fold lines -->
          <line x1="10" y1="210" x2="160" y2="130" stroke="#d4c5b5" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.4"/>
          <line x1="310" y1="210" x2="160" y2="130" stroke="#d4c5b5" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.4"/>
          
          <!-- Envelope flap (top triangle) -->
          <path d="M 10 60 L 160 155 L 310 60 Z" fill="#ede6df" stroke="#d4c5b5" stroke-width="2" class="envelope-flap-svg" style="transform-origin: 160px 60px;"/>
          
          <!-- Flap shadow -->
          <path d="M 12 62 L 160 150 L 308 62" fill="none" stroke="rgba(0,0,0,0.06)" stroke-width="3" class="envelope-flap-svg"/>
        </svg>
        
        <!-- Heart seal on top of envelope -->
        <div class="envelope-seal" id="envelopeSeal">
          <div class="seal-circle">
            <span class="seal-heart">💖</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <p class="envelope-text">Toca para abrir</p>
    </div>

    <div class="letter-paper" id="letterPaper">
      <div class="letter-header">
        <div class="letter-deco-left">🌸 ✨ 🌸</div>
        <h2 class="letter-date">14 de Febrero, 2026</h2>
        <div class="letter-deco-right">🌸 ✨ 🌸</div>
      </div>

      <div class="letter-body">
        <p class="letter-greeting">Mi Yuli bonita,</p>
        
        <p class="letter-paragraph reveal-left">
          Te conocí siendo un amigo más, ansioso de jugar y conocer,
          de crear lazos nuevos y vivir historias bonitas. Pero pasó
          algo raro... algo que no esperaba: empecé a sentir mariposas
          donde antes solo había curiosidad. 💕
        </p>

        <p class="letter-paragraph reveal-right">
          Eh de confesar que por más que pasamos tiempo juntos,
          hay tanto de tu ser que quiero seguir descubriendo despacio,
          sin forzar nada, porque lo que es hermoso se cuida con
          paciencia y con cariño. ✨
        </p>

        <p class="letter-paragraph reveal-left">
          Este loco que te escribe está aprendiendo que amar bonito
          no es solo sentir, sino también respetar tu camino.
          Y aunque a veces la distancia se siente grande,
          tu voz la hace pequeña en un instante. 🌸
        </p>

        <p class="letter-paragraph reveal-right">
          Siendo tu amigo soy feliz, mi niña, pero hay algo más
          que late fuerte por aquí. No quiero molestarte con
          mis maneras de rarito soñador... solo quiero que sepas
          que todo lo que hago, lo hago queriendo bonito. 💖
        </p>

        <p class="letter-paragraph reveal-left">
          Mi vida, desde lo más profundo de este corazón:
          creo que ambos podríamos intentar algo bien bonito.
          Pero si no, qué le puedo hacer... tus manías son parte
          de tu ser y las adoro todas, y la verdad no me molestaría
          seguir aquí, cerca, siendo lo que tú necesites. 💕
        </p>

        <p class="letter-closing reveal">
          Con todo el cariño de este tonto,
        </p>
        <p class="letter-signature reveal">
          Tu Josii 💕
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Decorative hamsters on the letter -->
      <div class="letter-hamster letter-hamster-left">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" width="60" height="60">
          <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="25" fill="#f4d4a0"/>
          <ellipse cx="25" cy="22" rx="8" ry="10" fill="#f4d4a0"/>
          <ellipse cx="25" cy="22" rx="5" ry="6" fill="#ffb6c1"/>
          <ellipse cx="55" cy="22" rx="8" ry="10" fill="#f4d4a0"/>
          <ellipse cx="55" cy="22" rx="5" ry="6" fill="#ffb6c1"/>
          <circle cx="32" cy="37" r="4" fill="#2c2c2c"/>
          <circle cx="31" cy="36" r="1.5" fill="#fff"/>
          <circle cx="48" cy="37" r="4" fill="#2c2c2c"/>
          <circle cx="47" cy="36" r="1.5" fill="#fff"/>
          <ellipse cx="40" cy="43" rx="2.5" ry="2" fill="#ffb6c1"/>
          <path d="M 35 47 Q 40 52 45 47" fill="none" stroke="#e8a080" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <ellipse cx="25" cy="43" rx="6" ry="4" fill="#ffb6c1" opacity="0.4"/>
          <ellipse cx="55" cy="43" rx="6" ry="4" fill="#ffb6c1" opacity="0.4"/>
          <!-- Tiny heart -->
          <text x="38" y="18" font-size="10">💖</text>
        </svg>
      </div>

      <div class="letter-hamster letter-hamster-right">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 80 80" width="60" height="60">
          <circle cx="40" cy="40" r="25" fill="#f4d4a0"/>
          <ellipse cx="25" cy="22" rx="8" ry="10" fill="#f4d4a0"/>
          <ellipse cx="25" cy="22" rx="5" ry="6" fill="#ffb6c1"/>
          <ellipse cx="55" cy="22" rx="8" ry="10" fill="#f4d4a0"/>
          <ellipse cx="55" cy="22" rx="5" ry="6" fill="#ffb6c1"/>
          <!-- Closed happy eyes -->
          <path d="M 28 37 Q 32 33 36 37" fill="none" stroke="#2c2c2c" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <path d="M 44 37 Q 48 33 52 37" fill="none" stroke="#2c2c2c" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <ellipse cx="40" cy="43" rx="2.5" ry="2" fill="#ffb6c1"/>
          <path d="M 35 47 Q 40 52 45 47" fill="none" stroke="#e8a080" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <ellipse cx="25" cy="43" rx="6" ry="4" fill="#ffb6c1" opacity="0.4"/>
          <ellipse cx="55" cy="43" rx="6" ry="4" fill="#ffb6c1" opacity="0.4"/>
          <text x="38" y="18" font-size="10">✨</text>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const envelope = document.getElementById('envelope');
  const letterPaper = document.getElementById('letterPaper');
  const seal = document.getElementById('envelopeSeal');

  envelope?.addEventListener('click', () => {
    if (envelope.classList.contains('opened')) return;
    
    // Step 1: Heart seal fades out & breaks
    envelope.classList.add('seal-breaking');
    
    setTimeout(() => {
      // Step 2: Flap opens, interior visible
      envelope.classList.add('flap-opening');
    }, 400);

    setTimeout(() => {
      // Step 3: Letter peeks out
      envelope.classList.add('letter-peeking');
    }, 900);

    setTimeout(() => {
      // Step 4: Envelope fades away
      envelope.classList.add('opened');
    }, 1500);

    setTimeout(() => {
      // Step 5: Real letter appears
      if (letterPaper) {
        letterPaper.classList.add('visible');
      }
    }, 2000);
  });
</script>

<style>
  .love-letter-section {
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100dvh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 60px 20px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #0a0a0a 0%, #120810 50%, #0a0a0a 100%);
    position: relative;
  }

  .letter-container {
    max-width: 700px;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
  }

  /* ===== ENVELOPE ===== */
  .envelope-wrapper {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: transform 0.3s;
    z-index: 2;
    position: relative;
  }

  .envelope-wrapper:hover {
    transform: scale(1.03);
  }

  .envelope-svg-container {
    position: relative;
    width: 280px;
    height: 200px;
  }

  .envelope-svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 25px rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.15));
    transition: filter 0.3s;
  }

  .envelope-wrapper:hover .envelope-svg {
    filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 35px rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.3));
  }

  /* Heart seal */
  .envelope-seal {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    z-index: 10;
    transition: all 0.5s ease-out;
  }

  .seal-circle {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    background: radial-gradient(circle, #c0392b 0%, #922b21 70%, #7b241c 100%);
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    box-shadow: 
      0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3),
      inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2),
      0 0 15px rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.2);
    animation: sealGlow 2.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes sealGlow {
    0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), 0 0 15px rgba(255,105,180,0.2); }
    50% { box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), inset 0 1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.2), 0 0 30px rgba(255,105,180,0.4); }
  }

  .seal-heart {
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    animation: heartBeat 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes heartBeat {
    0%, 100% { transform: scale(1); }
    15% { transform: scale(1.15); }
    30% { transform: scale(1); }
    45% { transform: scale(1.1); }
  }

  .envelope-text {
    font-family: var(--font-handwrite);
    color: var(--pink-light);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    margin-top: 12px;
    animation: fadeInOut 2s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInOut {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 0.5; }
    50% { opacity: 1; }
  }

  /* ===== ANIMATION STEPS ===== */

  /* Step 1: Seal breaks / fades */
  .envelope-wrapper.seal-breaking .envelope-seal {
    animation: sealBreak 0.5s ease-out forwards;
  }

  .envelope-wrapper.seal-breaking .envelope-text {
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s;
  }

  @keyframes sealBreak {
    0% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1) rotate(0deg); opacity: 1; }
    40% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(1.3) rotate(5deg); opacity: 0.8; }
    100% { transform: translate(-50%, -50%) scale(0.3) rotate(-15deg); opacity: 0; }
  }

  /* Step 2: Flap opens */
  .envelope-wrapper.flap-opening .envelope-flap-svg {
    animation: flapOpen 0.6s ease-in-out forwards;
  }

  .envelope-wrapper.flap-opening .envelope-interior {
    animation: showInterior 0.6s ease-out forwards;
  }

  @keyframes flapOpen {
    0% { transform: rotateX(0deg); }
    100% { transform: rotateX(180deg); opacity: 0.3; }
  }

  @keyframes showInterior {
    0% { opacity: 0; }
    100% { opacity: 1; }
  }

  /* Step 3: Letter peeks out */
  .envelope-wrapper.letter-peeking .envelope-letter-peek {
    animation: letterPeek 0.5s ease-out forwards;
  }

  @keyframes letterPeek {
    0% { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(0); }
    100% { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(-15px); }
  }

  /* Step 4: Whole envelope fades */
  .envelope-wrapper.opened {
    animation: envelopeFadeOut 0.6s ease-out forwards;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  @keyframes envelopeFadeOut {
    0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }
    50% { transform: scale(0.95) translateY(-10px); opacity: 0.5; }
    100% { transform: scale(0.85) translateY(-30px); opacity: 0; height: 0; margin: 0; }
  }

  /* ===== LETTER PAPER ===== */
  .letter-paper {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1a1218, #0f0a0e);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.3);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 50px 40px;
    position: relative;
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(30px) scale(0.95);
    transition: all 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.2, 1);
    box-shadow: 
      0 0 40px rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.1),
      inset 0 0 80px rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.02);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .letter-paper::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(
      transparent,
      transparent 38px,
      rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.05) 38px,
      rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.05) 39px
    );
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .letter-paper.visible {
    opacity: 1;
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
  }

  .letter-header {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    padding-bottom: 20px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.2);
  }

  .letter-deco-left,
  .letter-deco-right {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 5px;
  }

  .letter-date {
    font-family: var(--font-handwrite);
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--pink-light);
    margin: 8px 0;
  }

  .letter-greeting {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    color: var(--pink);
    margin-bottom: 25px;
    text-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(255, 105, 180, 0.3);
  }

  .letter-paragraph {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 2;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    text-align: justify;
  }

  .letter-paragraph em {
    color: var(--pink);
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .letter-closing {
    font-family: var(--font-handwrite);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--pink-light);
    margin-top: 30px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .letter-signature {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 2rem;
    color: var(--pink);
    text-align: right;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .letter-hamster {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 15px;
    opacity: 0.6;
    animation: hamsterPeek 4s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  .letter-hamster-left {
    left: 15px;
  }

  .letter-hamster-right {
    right: 15px;
    animation-delay: 2s;
  }

  @keyframes hamsterPeek {
    0%, 100% { transform: translateY(5px) rotate(-3deg); }
    50% { transform: translateY(-5px) rotate(3deg); }
  }

  /* ===== MOBILE ===== */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .love-letter-section {
      padding: 50px 10px;
    }
    .letter-container {
      width: 100%;
    }
    .envelope-svg-container {
      width: 240px;
      height: 170px;
    }
    .seal-circle {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
    }
    .seal-heart {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }
    .letter-paper {
      padding: 25px 18px;
    }
    .letter-greeting {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
    .letter-paragraph {
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      text-align: left;
    }
    .letter-closing {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
    }
    .letter-signature {
      font-size: 1.6rem;
    }
    .letter-hamster {
      display: none;
    }
    .letter-deco-left,
    .letter-deco-right {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
    }
    .letter-date {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .envelope-svg-container {
      width: 210px;
      height: 150px;
    }
    .seal-circle {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
    }
    .seal-heart {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
    }
    .letter-paper {
      padding: 20px 15px;
    }
    .letter-greeting {
      font-size: 1.4rem;
    }
    .letter-paragraph {
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }
  }
</style>
